# Notion MCP — documentation workspace

`Last updated: 2026-05-21 (Notion tables: full-width colgroup).`

**MCP server:** `notion` (global `.cursor/mcp.json` → `https://mcp.notion.com/mcp`)

When the user asks to **document in Notion**, **keep a Notion page updated**, or **add to the knowledge hub**, use Notion MCP — not only local markdown.

---

## P0 — Search order

| Step | Where | When |
|------|--------|------|
| 1 | **Notion MCP `notion-search`** | Find existing page before creating duplicates |
| 2 | **`notion-fetch`** | Read current page content before update |
| 3 | Local `findings/notion/*.md` | Draft / backup source; sync to Notion after edit |
| 4 | **`findings/lululemon_knowledge_bank.md`** | Curated recap — link to Notion, don't duplicate long UI docs |

---

